<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50490" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴμοροι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμοι</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴμπασις</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμπασις</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰμπάταὁν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμβλεψον</span> (Paph.), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰμπλατία</span></b> , ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπλ-</span>, a sacrificial
				<i>cake,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				5(2).4
			</span></i> (Tegea, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰμπολά</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπολή</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰμπόλης:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληπτής</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (perh. <i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπολεύς</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴμπτω</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴπτω</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴμψιος</span></b> , epith. of
			Poseidon in Syria, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵν</span></b> , dat. and acc. of the
			old pers. Pron. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵ</span> (q.v.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰν</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cypr.
			</span></i>, and Cret. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν</span>
		(q.v.).</div>
